cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or workflow, please cite the article below (and, if useful, this repository)."
type: software
title: "Coffee mapping workflow: Interpretable multi-sensor mapping of coffee production systems in Dak Lak, Vietnam"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline (Google Earth Engine scripts + Python notebooks) for a
  provincial-scale, interpretable multi-sensor (Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Landsat
  8/9, SRTM DEM) Random Forest classification of coffee production systems and
  land cover in Dak Lak Province, Vietnam, including spatial block
  cross-validation, SHAP-based interpretation, and Olofsson (2014) area-weighted
  accuracy/area estimation.
